@startuml
' ============================================================================
' METADATA
'   author:       TheRobotDrafts Examples
'   description:  Simple interaction overview - an activity flow whose nodes are interaction (sequence-diagram) uses.
'   usecase:      Teach interaction-use (ref) as a node, control flow between interactions, one decision.
'   complexity:   simple
'   domain:       Checkout flow
' ============================================================================
title Example Interaction Overview - Simple Checkout

' An interaction overview diagram is an activity diagram whose action nodes
' are interactions (sequence diagrams). Each `ref` rectangle references
' another interaction by name instead of being an opaque action.

start

' Interaction-use node: references the "BrowseCatalog" interaction diagram.
ref over "BrowseCatalog"

' A decision guards which interaction runs next based on a condition.
if (Cart empty?) then (yes)
  ref over "ShowEmpty"
else (no)
  ref over "CheckoutCart"
endif

ref over "ConfirmOrder"

stop

@enduml
